      "title": "My latest books cartoon for The Guardian ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s640x960/03c17d5e012ea10540d5ef8cbe355571388dfd10.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"836\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Image: In a childrens library, a small boy contentedly reads a small picture book, while an angry-looking small girl storms past, carrying a very heavy book.  Caption: Unfortunately for Charlotte, the adjudication committee decides that, for the purposes of the under-nines summer reading challenge, the six volumes of proust's 'in search of lost time' is considered to be one single narrative, whereas each of Roger hargreaves' mister men' books is a distinct work, thereby awarding the library's 'top reader' sticker to her brother Toby.\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s75x75_c1/bbc08af0e39332fbde1906b1f94e3d0a545aefb4.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s100x200/802448dcf1e611fb18da9ecc567f06314b1dd167.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s250x400/d6bf97255fd5e23c5bf499e475c7f4fd86464568.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s400x600/06ebacfbe4a743dbb332b3100ff66fe680f7692c.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s500x750/e8f7b316c6848f798babe146ef9099dee5f036df.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s540x810/ea223a5fc69cc4783092b7f941aaa7ff0dcadbc0.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s640x960/03c17d5e012ea10540d5ef8cbe355571388dfd10.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s1280x1920/0dc152eaf31d53f90e9535dda1a3b9afc5ecc0de.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/1899891dc85446d49759e2d0484314d6/cee5d408a76494a1-f1/s2048x3072